# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Read by `pnpm data:sync` and by the site's server
# (`pnpm --filter web serve:ssr`; in production, set the variable in the environment).

# A GitHub token for the data sync: any classic or fine-grained token works, no scope needed
# (it only reads public repositories). Without one GitHub allows 60 API requests an hour, which
# the sync exceeds and which the live package check (/libraries/check) shares with every visitor.
# https://github.com/settings/tokens
GITHUB_TOKEN=
